<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Randgold says progress made on Knights buy.</title>
<headline>Randgold says progress made on Knights buy.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Randgold and Exploration Company Ltd said on Monday satisfactory progress was being made in establishing a new company which will take over Knights Gold Mining Co and and would also try to acquire the land-clearing and gold-recovery operations of RMP Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>Randgold and Australian-based Continental Goldfields, which has an indirect 29 percent stake in Knights, said in a cautionary annoucement shareholders should continue to exercise caution in dealing shares until a further announcement is made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482 1003</p>
</text>
